      "source": "A <a href=\"ResourceTransformer.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.web.servlet.resource\"><code>ResourceTransformer</code></a> that checks a\n<a href=\"../../../cache/Cache.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.cache\"><code>Cache</code></a> to see if a previously transformed resource\nexists in the cache and returns it if found, and otherwise delegates to the resolver\nchain and saves the result in the cache.",
